{
  "uid": "streamclone-pulse-capacity",
  "title": "StreamPulse — Pulse capacity & coverage",
  "tags": ["streamclone", "pulse", "bearhost", "ops-001"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "description": "OPS-001 — live Pulse IRC tracking caps, extension backfill concurrency, go-live → first rollup SLOs, and analytics scrape health.",
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "About",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## Pulse capacity & coverage SLOs (OPS-001)\nMetrics from **`analytics`** `/metrics` (Prometheus job `analytics`). Configured caps (BearHost profile): **`PULSE_MAX_ACTIVE_CHANNELS=10`**, **`PULSE_MAX_BACKFILLS=1`** — reference lines on gauge panels.\n\n**Operator access:** SSH tunnel only (`make bearhost-grafana-tunnel`) until Cloudflare Access on `grafana.streampulse.stream` (INFRA-004). Runbook: [`docs/pulse-extension/pulse-metrics-runbook.md`](../../docs/pulse-extension/pulse-metrics-runbook.md)."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Capacity vs caps",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 4 },
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "gauge",
      "title": "Active tracked channels",
      "description": "pulse_active_tracked_channels vs configured cap (10)",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 5 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "min": 0,
          "max": 12,
          "decimals": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 8 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 10 }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] },
        "showThresholdLabels": false,
        "showThresholdMarkers": true
      },
      "targets": [{
        "expr": "max(pulse_active_tracked_channels{job=\"analytics\"})",
        "legendFormat": "active",
        "refId": "A"
      }]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "gauge",
      "title": "Active Pulse backfill jobs",
      "description": "pulse_backfill_active_jobs vs PULSE_MAX_BACKFILLS (1)",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 8, "x": 8, "y": 5 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "min": 0,
          "max": 3,
          "decimals": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 1 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 2 }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] },
        "showThresholdLabels": false,
        "showThresholdMarkers": true
      },
      "targets": [{
        "expr": "max(pulse_backfill_active_jobs{job=\"analytics\"})",
        "legendFormat": "active backfills",
        "refId": "A"
      }]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Analytics scrape up",
      "description": "Prometheus up{job=\"analytics\"}",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 5 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": { "color": "red", "index": 1, "text": "DOWN" },
                "1": { "color": "green", "index": 0, "text": "UP" }
              }
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "green", "value": 1 }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }
      },
      "targets": [{
        "expr": "max(up{job=\"analytics\"})",
        "legendFormat": "up",
        "refId": "A"
      }]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Active channels vs cap (time series)",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 11 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 10, "lineWidth": 2 },
          "decimals": 0
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "cap (10)" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "custom.lineStyle", "value": { "dash": [10, 10], "fill": "dash" } },
              { "id": "color", "value": { "fixedColor": "orange", "mode": "fixed" } }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "max(pulse_active_tracked_channels{job=\"analytics\"})",
          "legendFormat": "active tracked",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "vector(10)",
          "legendFormat": "cap (10)",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Active backfills vs cap (time series)",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 11 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 10, "lineWidth": 2 },
          "decimals": 0
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "cap (1)" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "custom.lineStyle", "value": { "dash": [10, 10], "fill": "dash" } },
              { "id": "color", "value": { "fixedColor": "orange", "mode": "fixed" } }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "max(pulse_backfill_active_jobs{job=\"analytics\"})",
          "legendFormat": "active backfills",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "vector(1)",
          "legendFormat": "cap (1)",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Go-live & coverage SLOs",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 18 },
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Go-live detections / min",
      "description": "pulse_golive_detected_total by source class",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 19 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 15, "lineWidth": 2 }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "targets": [{
        "expr": "sum by (source) (rate(pulse_golive_detected_total{job=\"analytics\"}[5m])) * 60",
        "legendFormat": "{{source}}",
        "refId": "A"
      }]
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Go-live → first rollup latency (p95 / p99)",
      "description": "pulse_golive_to_first_rollup_seconds histogram",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 19 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 0, "lineWidth": 2 }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(pulse_golive_to_first_rollup_seconds_bucket{job=\"analytics\"}[15m])) by (le))",
          "legendFormat": "p95",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum(rate(pulse_golive_to_first_rollup_seconds_bucket{job=\"analytics\"}[15m])) by (le))",
          "legendFormat": "p99",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Tracked from start (rate / h)",
      "description": "pulse_tracked_from_start_total — first rollup within 120s of go-live",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 26 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "decimals": 2,
          "unit": "ops"
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }
      },
      "targets": [{
        "expr": "sum(rate(pulse_tracked_from_start_total{job=\"analytics\"}[1h])) * 3600",
        "legendFormat": "per hour",
        "refId": "A"
      }]
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Duplicate go-live observations",
      "description": "pulse_golive_duplicate_observation_total rate",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 26 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "decimals": 3,
          "unit": "ops"
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }
      },
      "targets": [{
        "expr": "sum(rate(pulse_golive_duplicate_observation_total{job=\"analytics\"}[15m]))",
        "legendFormat": "dup/s",
        "refId": "A"
      }]
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Coverage start offset (p50 / p95)",
      "description": "pulse_coverage_start_offset_seconds histogram",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 26 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 0, "lineWidth": 2 }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum(rate(pulse_coverage_start_offset_seconds_bucket{job=\"analytics\"}[15m])) by (le))",
          "legendFormat": "p50",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(pulse_coverage_start_offset_seconds_bucket{job=\"analytics\"}[15m])) by (le))",
          "legendFormat": "p95",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Backend health & HTTP errors",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 34 },
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Prometheus scrape up (analytics)",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 35 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "decimals": 0,
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": { "color": "red", "text": "down" },
                "1": { "color": "green", "text": "up" }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "single" }
      },
      "targets": [{
        "expr": "max(up{job=\"analytics\"})",
        "legendFormat": "up",
        "refId": "A"
      }]
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "HTTP 5xx / sec (analytics)",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 8, "x": 8, "y": 35 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 20, "lineWidth": 2 }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "targets": [{
        "expr": "sum(rate(http_requests_total{job=\"analytics\",status=~\"5..\"}[5m]))",
        "legendFormat": "5xx/s",
        "refId": "A"
      }]
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "HTTP 4xx / sec (analytics)",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 35 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 10, "lineWidth": 2 }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "targets": [{
        "expr": "sum(rate(http_requests_total{job=\"analytics\",status=~\"4..\"}[5m]))",
        "legendFormat": "4xx/s",
        "refId": "A"
      }]
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "HTTP request rate by status class (analytics)",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 41 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 15, "lineWidth": 1, "stacking": { "mode": "normal" } }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "showLegend": true },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "targets": [{
        "expr": "sum by (status) (rate(http_requests_total{job=\"analytics\"}[5m]))",
        "legendFormat": "{{status}}",
        "refId": "A"
      }]
    }
  ],
  "time": { "from": "now-6h", "to": "now" },
  "timepicker": {},
  "templating": { "list": [] },
  "annotations": { "list": [] }
}
